OL,3,GNEWSADeath of girl, 11, 'unexplained'
OL,4,Aafter body found
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearby residents were told by the force
OL,7,Fthat there would be an increased police
OL,8,Fpresence in the area as they
OL,9,Finvestigate.
